meanings
  formalization-relation
    defined-by formalization-relation
    denotation relation
    connotation concept
    role relation_predicate
    precondition "source and target concepts are available"
    effect "records a typed relation between formalized concepts"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "precondition relates a method to what must hold before it runs"
